# /andre kiosk hardware

`/andre` (2. etasje hallway) will run as a Chromium kiosk on a **Raspberry Pi 5** with the official Raspberry Pi **7" Touch Display 2** (version 2 of the Pi 7" panel).

| | |
| -- | -- |
| Board | Raspberry Pi 5 |
| Screen | Official Raspberry Pi 7" Touch Display 2 |
| Resolution | **720×1280** |
| Orientation | **Portrait** |
| Input | Touch-first — do not rely on hover |

Design and CSS for `/andre` against this panel (`src/pages/Andre/Andre.css`, `max-width: 720px`). Shared UI (e.g. `SonosFocus`) must work in this portrait box: stacked player, not Stue’s landscape two-column overlay.

This kiosk is **not** in `npm run deploy` yet (no LAN address in `scripts/deploy.sh`). It will load the app from the Stue server, same pattern as Entre.
